e  \n28,1983 is hereby amended to provide as follows:\n“The Commission shall be composed of no more than thirty members appoint­\ned or designated by the President.”.\nTHE W H ITE HOUSE, \nSeptember 8, 1983.\n[FR Doc. 63-24956 \nFiled 9-9-83; 10:46 am]","path":"jobs/clause-drafts/output/texts/cd-job-fr-originals-12440-232d4d2a36.txt","sha256":"b404f35e181613bff7798b4130e422fcf1004b5aadcd57078071fe28d7495ee1","source":{"line":2994,"path":"jobs/clause-drafts/output/SOURCES.jsonl","record_sha256":"53197d4d32c9b194f981e8fec38c919483c3d1c3d3a0a760aa96b38cbe43a0a1"}},{"first_1500_characters":"Instrument: EO:12440\nSource: https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1983-09-12/pdf/FR-1983-09-12.pdf\nSHA-256 of the downloaded file: 232d4d2a3618d3f38e6b84dddb6b0838e2c8ce17f0887595c5df65387ee6127f\nLocation: 48 FR 40873, PDF pages 11-11 (confidence high)\nMachine-extracted text layer of the official PDF (OCR for 1936-1994 scans). May contain recognition errors and parts of neighbouring documents on the same pages. Not an authenticated transcription: check the PDF pages.\n\n=== PDF page 11 of 152 ===\nFederal Register /  Vol. 48, No. 177 /  Monday, September 1 2,1983 /  Presidential Documents 40873\nPresidential Documents\nExecutive Order 12440 of September 8, 1983\nPresident’s Commission on Industrial Competitiveness\nBy the authority vested in me as President by the Constitution and law s of the  \nUnited States of A m erica, including the Federal, Advisory Committee A ct, as  \namended (5 U.S.C. App. I), and in order to increase the membership of the  \nPresident’s Commission on Industrial Competitiveness, it is hereby ordered  \nthat the second sentence of Section 1(a) of Executive Order No. 12428 of June  \n28,1983 is hereby amended to provide as follows:\n“The Commission shall be composed of no more than thirty members appoint­\ned or designated by the President.”.\nTHE W H ITE HOUSE, \nSeptember 8, 1983.\n[FR Doc. 63-24956 \nFiled 9-9-83; 10:46 am] \nBilling code 3195-01-M\n